UID:10014420-1787392800-1787407200@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Sculptural Papermaking with Bev Barnett
DESCRIPTION:Sculptural Papermaking with Bev Barnett in Davis \nSaturday\, August 22 | 10 AM – 2 PM \n$115 Members\, $125 Non-Members (All materials included) \n  \nWith artist Bev Barnett\, embark on a unique adventure to transform ordinary household recycling\, kitchen waste\, and foraged botanicals into textured handmade paper that tells a compelling story. In this workshop\, we’ll move beyond the notion that paper should be flat\, creating low-relief sculpture and highly textured sheets. You’ll master a simple\, low-water method using a household blender to macerate pulp and learn how to incorporate color without messy dyes. By the time you leave\, you’ll have 8 to 10 handmade papers\, a blueprint for your own home studio\, and the confidence to keep creating. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \n  \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/sculptural-papermaking-with-bev-barnett/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Bev-Barnett-copy-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
