SUMMARY:4th Friday Kickback & Classic Car Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Downtown Winters for our 4th Friday Kickback & Classic Car Show\, happening every 4th Friday from March through October! \nEnjoy an evening filled with live music\, classic cars\, local shopping\, outdoor dining\, family-friendly fun\, and the small-town charm that makes Winters so special. \nStroll Main Street\, grab dinner or a drink from your favorite local spots\, and check out an incredible lineup of classic cars throughout downtown. \nWhether you’re a car enthusiast or simply looking for a fun night out\, there’s something for everyone at 4th Fridays in Winters! \nLOCATION: Downtown Main Street\nDATE & TIME: 4th Friday March – October\, 5:30PM-9:30PM
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/4th-friday-kickback-classic-car-show/2026-08-28/
LOCATION:Downtown Winters\, Main Street\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/4th-friday.jpg
END:VEVENT
